%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51fb4c6070f247e48b4377b5728b8182, type: 3}
  m_Name: S7_X1_3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StoryScene
  sentences:
  - text: I feel like it's my fault the mood turned sour.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Um, is everything alright?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Yes, this does not concern you, so you needn't worry. Please just ignore
      it. I will send an email to all employees regarding work as soon as we get
      out of this bunker.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0da3ca1f8a6962f4b9b7873516fd35e9, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I don't want to just leave her like this though. I haven't even introduced
      myself to her family.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I apologise. If I've offended anyone, I would like to-
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Enough! As I've mentioned before, I hate to mix business with personal
      matters. I have nothing work-related to discuss with you anymore. I will see
      you at work soon.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0da3ca1f8a6962f4b9b7873516fd35e9, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "I was just trying to fix things \u2026 Why is she so hostile?"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Alright, I understand. Have a nice day, everyone.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: And with that I distance myself from my boss and the rest of them.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 3
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I guess it's my fault for trying to mind someone else's business when I'm
      not in the place to do so.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: But the way Miss Moon spoke to me kind of hurt. I was hoping we could maybe
      get a little closer today, but maybe it's still too early for that.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0a531472eb715104e8acc946d055c0dd, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b6b0f2b9e6f8a8b4c8b1b68b5e4d9c1a, type: 2}
